OL,3,GNEWSAWe ship our gym equipment all over
OL,4,Athe world
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Greg Bradley started the his gym
OL,7,Fequipment company 14 years ago, someone
OL,8,Ftold him he would never sell outside
OL,9,Fthe island of Ireland.
OL,11,F"I remember thinking, 'I'm going to
OL,12,Fprove you wrong'," he said.
OL,13,F"Thankfully, we have been able to do
OL,14,Fthat."
OL,16,FBLK BOX is based in Newtownabbey - but
OL,17,Fit has secured contracts with
OL,18,Fhigh-profile customers all over the
OL,19,Fworld, from sports teams like
OL,20,FManchester United to chains like
OL,21,FPureGym.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
